  "packageHash": "egcuVeBsjGf37Wc/DMUNZyrk9YvMyO7Payd4BgO1jmZuPCARxOEdUx6ZSVpUndsMxsC1umq4W/TmxyFCPIQbOw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 343970,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-10-29T17:55:35.467Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.3: encoder work. Lossless efforts 1-6 follow libjxl Modular tiers (per-channel gradient, fixed gradient/weighted-predictor trees, smaller learned trees; 8-bit effort 7-9 unchanged), 1.2-14x faster than 0.8.2 where every effort coded as 7. 16-bit lossless: palette for samples above 32767 and per-channel compaction (widened 8-bit content about 3x smaller). Lossy encoding about 9% faster (lane-ordered entropy sums; rare decision changes with the same sizes and decoded pixels). Decoding unchanged. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.3.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
